{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "f142e32157bc74a8348406d83b3021e7e2e0e58daabc093aa0ce5b3e6c5382db", "ja": "そうだ！　前に、食べてみたいって言ってたスイーツが\nあったっけ！　あれなんかいいかも……ふわぁ～。", "zh": "对了！之前好像说过想尝尝那种甜点来着！那个或许不错……呼啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "116f20a9864090c6b05f231e3847004d6025b316f6ab161b3ce50b9634104df2", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\n大丈夫ですか？　かなり眠そうですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。没事吧？看起来很困呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e564976457683e25400f75887d8201ba6f232dd4fca3205bbc9fab9723ed3ba0", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　えへへ……\n昨日、ちょっと友達と長電話しちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！嘿嘿……\n昨天跟朋友讲电话讲得有点久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "2698b08efe7578dcf53989997cc8d07376f8282bd35a532a2a0a35bb418146bc", "ja": "あ、でもお仕事はバリバリこなしますから！\n心配しないで、ドーンと任せてくださいね。", "zh": "啊，不过工作我可是会麻利地完成的！\n别担心，尽管放心交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "86c52055bccdc895dac9228256e44598c41f89aec0dce0bd68cfccd80bc4cf56", "ja": "そこは心配してませんよ。\nでも無理はしないで、休憩を取ってくださいね。", "zh": "这点我不担心。\n不过也别勉强自己，要记得休息哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "8b96c2438e284f97ab6d39a9176b52983122af320a0525cd73f88aa8a494e433", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nあ、そうそう、今日は事務所に行く日ですよね？", "zh": "谢谢您♪  \n啊，对了对了，今天是要去事务所的日子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e1a2d8b554d5bd2006bfb34630161bf2b2d622912d00b3a657f8689de6578373", "ja": "そろそろ『BATTLE OF THEATER』の時期ですし。\nもしかして、そのお話があるかも……？", "zh": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』也快到举办的时候了。\n说不定今天就是要谈这件事的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ea635a3fd992e0fcb7a891f523e8c2520867df9cf9f94e24cb0c5ca8a00b5fe2", "ja": "そうですね。今回もTV番組との連動企画が\n持ち上がっていて、今日はその打ち合わせです。", "zh": "是啊。这次也正在筹划和电视节目联动的企划，今天就是来商量这件事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "e145b49ca70d9127ab0dea3c5bd7476373220d235ffec0ec4b63c0c94b4b6172", "ja": "わぁ、それは楽しみですね♪\nお話を聞いて、一気に目が覚めちゃったかも！", "zh": "哇，真让人期待呢♪\n听您这么一说，感觉整个人一下子都清醒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1c6029e7b0b61efa30b4348d4a41787061edb3ec6e3dad185937f867c49d230e", "ja": "はは。それじゃ、行ってきますね。", "zh": "哈哈，那我先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "e4c06dd841e30adb8ae13417f2a1d77a4946ebcaaf8ad2d38647055f0c9f4442", "ja": "はーい、いってらっしゃい！\n気を付けてくださいね～！", "zh": "好——路上小心，早点回来！\n注意安全哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "89a5edb83465bb39989e598640d8e7fdb22ce90212547d7fdc8d593b580578f0", "ja": "失礼します！　今日はよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "打扰了！今天请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "3855a6889cd66faca7f3470ee14ef01a22e9c0af888d560c0a5901aada04dff4", "ja": "おお、君！　よく来てくれたね。\nちょうど、彼も来たところだよ。", "zh": "哦，是你啊！欢迎你来。\n他也刚刚到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1014_unknown", "source_sha256": "80f69f7a0096741b19a99c45d2979ae7ced7cf1e100beb46d7bde6fbfe1058a6", "ja": "おっと～？　アナタが765のピュロデューサーさん？\nジーマーでシゴデキってウワサの？　ヒュー！", "zh": "哦～？你就是765的制作人？\n听说你特别能干，是真的吗？哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa035b8e135a07aae6d65378112484cb18c300c1f5a339830512ab658b20650b", "ja": "えっ……ピュロ……？", "zh": "诶……皮尤……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "ac6da040fa79bce29cb72176553a17dd22b1ca526519e380c07eea025944d46f", "ja": "こちら、民放キー局の番組ディレクターさんです。\nなんでも、社長の古いお知り合いだとか。", "zh": "这位是民营电视台的节目导演先生。\n听说和社长是相识多年的老朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1017_director", "source_sha256": "b16b2652ab414661596622be0ca63d842d6ea3966d7e08ec35a8701806f3900c", "ja": "そそ！　駆け出しの頃からよくしていただいてて。\nなんで、遠慮はナシよりのナシってことで、シクヨロ！", "zh": "没错！从我刚出道的时候起就一直承蒙关照。\n所以，咱们就别客气啦，今后也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "614b93d09c09b847b7758ada7e76519d931d4770aaacbe7b8897d177e90bb83c", "ja": "は、はい、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是、是的，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "1934cce0d412b6f91093bbf40b20a2be6e7bdafe75e27b5974c5ad581e45b70c", "ja": "それでは……うおっほん！　顔見せもそこそこで\nすまないが、早速、本題に入らせてもらうとしよう。", "zh": "那么……咳咳！寒暄就先到这里，抱歉，接下来就直接进入正题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "7503bce3ad0bde9902a7814fb0da5b13743ad76391c864454f1fbd7bde256919", "ja": "今、我々が進行中の企画『BATTLE OF THEATER』\nと、彼の番組チームがコラボしたいそうでね。", "zh": "现在我们正在推进的企划《BATTLE OF THEATER》，\n听说想和他的节目团队合作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1021_director", "source_sha256": "1df8ba905186f26eda9b4d77e9d2581b6dece120972c323c1e76d816ef334094", "ja": "そーなんスよ！　ジーマーで神カッキー！\nスーセンにズキューンって感じで！", "zh": "就是这样啦！真的帅到神乎其技！\n被那视线一击命中，心里砰的一声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1022_director", "source_sha256": "56bb3a38be6994712aa490f65772735c809fe5913b0b92290ca0d207047f343b", "ja": "最近じゃウチらテレビ屋も、キューに押されて\nケツカッチンでね……ジーマーでノーマーシー！", "zh": "最近啊，我们这些电视圈的人也被进度表压着，\n时间卡得死死的……真是没有一点余地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8f2b3041982f47b7f602a51661c6b38d4fdeb358eda44fd66c65f66b55778f37", "ja": "えっ、ええと……？", "zh": "诶，那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "1beb819d2a358724151ffc1a0f803ddac9aba5f4083b6f3e01cafda288419dda", "ja": "本当に神企画で、センスにズキューンときました！\n最近は局も制作に追われて、本当に情けない……", "zh": "真的是神级企划，品味一下就狠狠击中了我！最近电视台也忙于制作，实在是太没出息了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "66bbc34f08ddb684ebb6be22c3a1575e438d9d6598c003d3c8dd87bee1079af7", "ja": "……って仰っている気がします！", "zh": "感觉是在这么说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "412beca94fc492f9bab448c2804f944a37022d83f0f8b1cebaca972ee7b421be", "ja": "な、なるほど！　音無さん、凄いですね……？", "zh": "原、原来如此！音无小姐，真厉害啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1027_director", "source_sha256": "a5b51bb304008da8667c60faed3fee91e157823f24d6c4391cdcc4d7f8df46d8", "ja": "そこに来てこの神カッキー、ペッカンな取り回し……\nリスペクトしかないっスよ、ピュロさん！　クハーッ！", "zh": "再加上这神乎其神的帅气、令人叹为观止的运用……我只能表示尊敬了，皮尤罗先生！喝啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "85a9fb8fb3b404ee20b5d1d923cce155d3b1078d816540f31abe6cf755377d0e", "ja": "彼の番組はバラエティーなんだが、今回は\n短期特番で、地上波とウェブの同時オンエア予定だ。", "zh": "他的节目虽然是综艺节目，不过这次是短期特别节目，预计将在地面电视和网络同步播出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "e87a70f799f643e048fc70670e80e3ab46db9138b57751b51b3eb1ee8f896382", "ja": "出演するのは、次のメンバー達……つまり、\n高山紗代子君、野々原茜君、所恵美君の3人だよ。", "zh": "出演的成员是接下来的这些人……也就是说，是高山纱代子、野野原茜和所惠美，共3人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f81b2103161505291f167da4d5452c707d6cb5ca9a15af793c3e44759bcd8285", "ja": "おおっ、それは願ってもない話ですね！\n公演の認知度アップにも繋がりますし。", "zh": "哦哦，那真是求之不得啊！也能提高公演的知名度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "6313cc25363097d8d1a070c2f9e67f63abdf4e3640b520a64b19ea1cdfc37b36", "ja": "うむ！　では、正式に引き受けさせてもらうとして……\n引き続き、企画を詰めていこうじゃないか。", "zh": "嗯！那么，既然正式接下了这个任务……\n接下来就继续完善企划吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "bd0fa8e2458465efb22e7a00dbd93e638d70e3f89fbc2e5e73ddccc4e0f8de02", "ja": "どんな番組になるのか、楽しみですね！\nジーマーで、シクヨロです♪", "zh": "真期待会做成什么样的节目呢！真的请多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1033_director", "source_sha256": "345c29195c401e3408a223ee5c7810852c49ce6f6acc6b400e59ef97e5a3ff0c", "ja": "ピュロさんとなら、セツデンのグミバン、\nイケる気がするんスよね！　ジーマーで！", "zh": "和皮尤罗先生一起的话，我觉得节电软糖车肯定能行！真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "763de9511f8965b8a5eaea6a8003e522ecf49c43417ef1a61742c2385f7e50a4", "ja": "（な、なんか懐かしい感じのするディレクターさん\nだな……。とにかく、企画をまとめるぞ！）", "zh": "（真是位让人感觉很怀念的导演啊……。总之，先把企划整理好吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
